cmd-panicbunker_deny_vpn-desc = Enables or disables blocking access through VPN connections.
cmd-panicbunker_deny_vpn-help = Usage: panicbunker_deny_vpn <bool>
panicbunker-command-deny-vpn-enabled = The panic bunker will now block VPN connections.
panicbunker-command-deny-vpn-disabled = The panic bunker will no longer block VPN connections.
